ARCC Trial</collab></person-group><article-title>Temsirolimus, interferon alfa, or both for advanced renal-cell carcinoma</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2007</year><volume>356</volume><fpage>2271</fpage><lpage>2281</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'N Engl J Med||356|2271||bib11|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hudson</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Chiang</surname><given-names>GG</given-names></name><name><surname>Otterness</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Loomis</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaper</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Giaccia</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Abraham</surname><given-names>RT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Regulation of hypoxia-inducible factor 1alpha expression and function by the mammalian target of rapamycin</article-title><source>Mol Cell Biol</source><year>2002</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>7004</fpage><lpage>7014</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Mol Cell Biol||22|7004||bib12|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jusko</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Guidelines for collection and analysis of pharmacokinetic data</article-title><source>Applied Pharmacokinetics: Principles of Therapeutic Drug Monitoring</source><year>1992</year><publisher-name>Applied Therapeutics Inc: Vancouver, Wash</publisher-name><fpage>2.1</fpage><lpage>2.43</lpage>Evans WE, Schentag JJ, Jusko WJ (eds) pp</citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kovarik</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Beyer</surname